    <!-- The dua after the adhan, narrated by Jabir ibn Abdullah: Sahih al-Bukhari 614. -->
    <string name="dua_title" translatable="false">Dua after the adhan · الدعاء بعد الأذان</string>
    <string name="dua_arabic" translatable="false">اللَّهُمَّ رَبَّ هَذِهِ الدَّعْوَةِ التَّامَّةِ، وَالصَّلَاةِ الْقَائِمَةِ، آتِ مُحَمَّدًا الْوَسِيلَةَ وَالْفَضِيلَةَ، وَابْعَثْهُ مَقَامًا مَحْمُودًا الَّذِي وَعَدْتَهُ</string>
    <string name="dua_english" translatable="false">O Allah, Lord of this perfect call and of the prayer about to be established, grant Muhammad al-Wasīlah and excellence, and raise him to the praised station that You have promised him.</string>
    <string name="dua_source" translatable="false">Ṣaḥīḥ al-Bukhārī 614</string>
